  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "你有喜欢的明星吗？  (Do You Have a Favourite Celebrity?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wang_er": "王尔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With the revival-round plan approved, Wang Er sends Bu Xiaogu to coordinate with celebrity-data company Fentuan Tech — where quirky president Ji Xiu insists on guessing Xiaogu's secret crush. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "淳于总已经批准咱们的方案了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，你负责粉团科技。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我是总裁，叫我吉秀就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总您好，王尔老师让我来跟您接洽。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你有喜欢的明星吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你喜欢哪个明星？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，我们时间特别紧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "从喜欢的明星，就能看出一个人的性格。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "这个是你的菜吧？不好意思了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through the assignment and the quirky meeting at Fentuan Tech.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "淳于总已经批准咱们的方案了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Chun Yu has already approved our proposal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，你负责粉团科技。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, you are in charge of Fentuan Tech.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我是总裁，叫我吉秀就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am the president — just call me Ji Xiu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总您好，王尔老师让我来跟您接洽。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello President Ji; Teacher Wang Er sent me to coordinate with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你有喜欢的明星吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have a celebrity you like?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你喜欢哪个明星？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which celebrity do you like?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，我们时间特别紧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'President Ji, we are really pressed for time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "从喜欢的明星，就能看出一个人的性格。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From the celebrity someone likes, you can tell a person's personality.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "这个是你的菜吧？不好意思了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This one is your type, right? Now you are embarrassed!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "淳于总已经批准咱们的方案了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，你负责粉团科技。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "我是总裁，叫我吉秀就好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总您好，王尔老师让我来跟您接洽。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你有喜欢的明星吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你喜欢哪个明星？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，我们时间特别紧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "从喜欢的明星，就能看出一个人的性格。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "这个是你的菜吧？不好意思了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Flustered as she is by Ji Xiu's probing, Xiaogu walks out with the exact celebrity data Xingtian needs. You heard \"fuze\", \"nage\" for \"which\", and slang \"ni de cai\" for \"your type\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
